            "review_text": "TravelinGypsey\n305 contributions\n0\nDelicious 🤤\nJan 2021 • Friends\nDelicious 🤤 and excellent prices and portion sizes!!! Staff is knowledgeable and friendly!! It’s a quite, yet festive and relaxing atmosphere. Perfect for a casual evening with friends or a date. It was beautifully decorated for Christmas 🎄 as well! The veggie chow main was delicious, along with the peppered chicken and seafood dishes. They are open late, yet the food is always hot and fresh! Very happy with the service, price and taste!!! We will be back! \n\nFollow @travelingypsey on Instagram & GoogleMaps!!!\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2021",
